{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An RPG where something is off...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Make an original character in a surprisingly in depth pixel character creator, and then choose one of three worlds to set out. Your choices are your own, but the game has it's own devious plans for you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TeleCollision</strong> has turn based combat, with each character having a unique timing based action to master for increased damage. Your party is made up of a collection of colorful characters that find themselves deeply tied a story you've fallen into upon setting out on your journey. Each one has their own strengths and mechanical use against enemies that can't always be attacked head on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683370/extras/055010a2a0fe52e38be33a50972bf0ea.avif?t=1750308123\" width=800 height=247 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In traditional RPG fashion, your player character can change equipment to adjust their stats, but also has access to a menagerie of trading cards to equip to change their stats, abilities, and passive effects! There's an entire catalogue of trading cards to collect through exploration, purchasing, and opening trading card packs for a random chance at rare and powerful cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683370/extras/9e57f0a69f12d85b9e732a6b741e14bf.avif?t=1750308123\" data-has-big width=800 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TeleCollision's demo includes roughly 8 hours of content, and what is considered the first act of the game. Community feedback is welcome and appreciated at this stage of development as the combat is tweaked and polished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683370/extras/a23189091298c52feacb1cb079fc2975.poster.avif?t=1750308123\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683370/extras/a23189091298c52feacb1cb079fc2975.webm?t=1750308123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2683370?t=1750308123","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2683370?t=1750308123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683370/4380049d3197c1aaf9d960487dea13f68fceb7be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750308123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683370/4380049d3197c1aaf9d960487dea13f68fceb7be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750308123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2862510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An RPG where something is off...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Make an original character in a surprisingly in depth pixel character creator, and then choose one of three worlds to set out. Your choices are your own, but the game has it's own devious plans for you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TeleCollision</strong> has turn based combat, with each character having a unique timing based action to master for increased damage. Your party is made up of a collection of colorful characters that find themselves deeply tied a story you've fallen into upon setting out on your journey. Each one has their own strengths and mechanical use against enemies that can't always be attacked head on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683370/extras/055010a2a0fe52e38be33a50972bf0ea.avif?t=1750308123\" width=800 height=247 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In traditional RPG fashion, your player character can change equipment to adjust their stats, but also has access to a menagerie of trading cards to equip to change their stats, abilities, and passive effects! There's an entire catalogue of trading cards to collect through exploration, purchasing, and opening trading card packs for a random chance at rare and powerful cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683370/extras/9e57f0a69f12d85b9e732a6b741e14bf.avif?t=1750308123\" data-has-big width=800 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TeleCollision's demo includes roughly 8 hours of content, and what is considered the first act of the game. Community feedback is welcome and appreciated at this stage of development as the combat is tweaked and polished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683370/extras/a23189091298c52feacb1cb079fc2975.poster.avif?t=1750308123\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683370/extras/a23189091298c52feacb1cb079fc2975.webm?t=1750308123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Zachary Fox"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683370/d258af9b526ace7a234fad62a95a9b01aa96439c/header.jpg?t=1750308123","is_free"